<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12769] MetricRegistryMBean and OpenCensusExporterSpi have memory leak</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12769</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;MetricRegistryMBean&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;OpenCensusExporterSpi&lt;/tt&gt; have memory leak. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To the following maps values add but never remove (i.e. on remove corresponding histogram or on change histogram buckets layout):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;MetricRegistryMBean.histogramNames&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;OpenCensusMetricExporterSpi.histogramNames&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
